[l_english.landmark_nanjing_presidential_palace]
The Nanjing Presidential Palace

[l_english.landmark_nanjing_presidential_palace_desc]
The Presidential Palace at Nanjing is an ancient, prestigious complex where, upon the fall of the Qing dynasty, the great Sun Yat-sen himself was inaugurated.

